### 10. 添加用户主页配置
POST {{prefix}}/test/homePageUserConfig/add
Content-Type: application/json
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "configId": 1001,
  "userId": 2001,
  "userConfig": "TEST_配置方案A",
  "createBy": 3001,
  "createDate": "2025-03-22 09:15:00",
  "lastUpdateBy": 3001,
  "lastUpdateDate": "2025-03-22 10:30:00",
  "lastUpdateLogin": 4001
}

### 11. 根据用户ID查询配置
GET {{prefix}}/test/homePageUserConfig/findByUserId/2001
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 12. 根据用户ID删除配置
DELETE {{prefix}}/test/homePageUserConfig/deleteByUserId/2001
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}